meta {
  name: take stock
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}inventory/stock/take/
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    // Chamber location code. Required.
    "location": "A11",

    // Quantity to take, > 0. Required.
    "quantity": "6",

    // Project id to consume against. Optional; must be ACTIVE.
    "project": 1,

    // Optional.
    "note": "Drive motors for chassis v2"
  }
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Takes stock out of a chamber (FR-6.4). Any role. Can't take more than the
  chamber holds (FR-6.6). The optional `project` tag (FR-6.9) must be an
  active project. When the chamber reaches zero, the stock entry stays with
  quantity 0 until someone deletes it.

  Rules shared by every stock operation (FR-6):
  - Locations are chamber codes such as `A11` (case-insensitive).
  - A chamber holds one component type (FR-6.2).
  - Quantities must be greater than zero and whole numbers for units that don't allow fractions.
  - Each operation writes an immutable movement (FR-6.5) and runs with row locks, so concurrent operations can't drive a chamber below zero (FR-6.11).
  - The response has the `movement` and the resulting `stock_entries`.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Stock taken.",
    "movement": {
      "id": 5,
      "movement_type": "TAKE",
      "movement_type_display": "Take",
      "component": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "DC Gear Motor 12V",
        "part_number": "JGB37-520",
        "unit_symbol": "pcs"
      },
      "source_location": "A11",
      "destination_location": null,
      "quantity": "6.000",
      "quantity_before": null,
      "quantity_after": null,
      "unit_price": null,
      "delivery_charge": null,
      "performed_by": {
        "id": 3,
        "username": "nadia.islam",
        "email": "nadia.islam@example.com",
        "role": "STAFF"
      },
      "project": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Line Follower Robot",
        "status": "ACTIVE"
      },
      "related_movement": null,
      "note": "Drive motors for chassis v2",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.636966+06:00"
    },
    "stock_entries": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "location": "A11",
        "chamber": 1,
        "component": {
          "id": 1,
          "name": "DC Gear Motor 12V",
          "part_number": "JGB37-520",
          "unit_symbol": "pcs"
        },
        "quantity": "34.000",
        "note": "",
        "created_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.591057+06:00",
        "updated_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.636285+06:00"
      }
    ]
  }

  More than the chamber holds (400):
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Only 3 pcs available at C11."
  }

  Fraction of a whole-number unit (400):
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Pieces (pcs) does not allow fractional quantities."
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}
